            "date": "Jan 21, 2025",
            "id": "48f59b76-1de6-47c2-aae6-45bf1ff14a14",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "We are delighted Sea La Vie was the perfect home for your family to enjoy quality time together, and we appreciate your recommendation. Having you as our guests was a pleasure; we hope to welcome you back to the Emerald Coast soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "House was so perfect for our large family stay. Had five young children that enjoyed all of the features! Could have easily stayed at the property for multiple weeks. Host was very prompt and communicative if we had any questions. Cannot recommend this listing enough.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Perfect House with Great Space!",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Deborah B.",
        "date": "2025-07-21T15:42:11Z",
        "id": "687e6ecbd666427cb4c9064b",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We enjoyed our stay. The house was nice and we had more than enough room for everyone in our group. It is well located. It was also very nice to have access to the watercolor beach club that we used a lot. We did a combination of walking, using the cart, or driving to the beach depending on our plans. The walk was a little long for me in the mid-day sun, but the younger ones in our party didn't mind it. But we walked up to and back from the fireworks and that was very nice. It was nice to have all the options. Also very nice to have the pool for cooling off in the afternoon.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
